          "from": "ojo [ˈoxo] 'eye'",
          "to": "[ˈoho]",
          "note": "The from is the standard (Castilian) pronunciation with [x]. /x/ is pronounced [h] in western Andalusia, Extremadura, the Canaries, the Caribbean, Central America, Venezuela and coastal Colombia and Ecuador; eastern Andalusia keeps [x]."
        },
        {
          "from": "gente [ˈxente] 'people'",
          "to": "[ˈhente]",
          "note": "The same realization before front vowels, where /x/ is spelled ⟨g⟩."
